        "to": "all",
        "text": "Seat {seat}: {value}."
      },
      "text": "Card {current_card} is on offer with a pot of {pot}. TAKE it (you get the card and every chip in the pot) or PAY {pay_cost} chip into the pot to refuse it."
    },
